<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cȳănĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυάνεος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Dark-blue, sea-blue</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cyaneo colore avis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 32, 47, § 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stagna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Psych. 858</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cȳănĕae</span></b> ,
				ārum, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυάνεαι</span>, <i>the two small
				rocky islands at the entrance of the Pontus Euxinus, called
			also</i> Symplegades, q. v., <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 1,
				10, 34</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">errantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 4, 561</span></i>
			.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cȳă-nĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to the Cyaneæ</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cautes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					2, 716</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">montes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 2, 381</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rupes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					637</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ruinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					7, 19, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 7, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 13, 27, § 92
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>like the
				Cyaneæ</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 11, 99, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
